('14c5934c-29bd-3afa-5905-6c8a2e459fbb', 'en', 'That he gives them offices in the church'),
('b9c0f529-dd19-8d7d-591a-beb68aa470ed', 'de', 'Dass er ihnen die Türen verschließt zum Schutz'),
('b9c0f529-dd19-8d7d-591a-beb68aa470ed', 'en', 'That he shuts his doors to them for protection'),
('f15462fa-cf37-e2c5-ca20-c895c5cb1799', 'de', 'Dass er sie belehrt in der Lehre der Apostel'),
('f15462fa-cf37-e2c5-ca20-c895c5cb1799', 'en', 'That he instructs them in the apostles'' teaching'),
('4cae969c-cea9-1258-f2c7-3f2ff1b94a05', 'de', 'Dem Epaphras dem Beter'),
('4cae969c-cea9-1258-f2c7-3f2ff1b94a05', 'en', 'To Epaphras the intercessor'),
('4241dc12-c75b-98da-4dd5-da22916c4c4c', 'de', 'Dem Gaius dem Statthalter'),
('4241dc12-c75b-98da-4dd5-da22916c4c4c', 'en', 'To Gaius the governor'),
('6de9ee01-3a0e-f390-959e-c7a11f9f87db', 'de', 'Dem Onesimus dem Diener'),
('6de9ee01-3a0e-f390-959e-c7a11f9f87db', 'en', 'To Onesimus the servant'),
('55c6ecf2-c8b0-cfd9-6ed1-fd1a2a3214ab', 'de', 'Dem Demetrius, dem alle ein gutes Zeugnis geben'),
('55c6ecf2-c8b0-cfd9-6ed1-fd1a2a3214ab', 'en', 'To Demetrius, to whom all give a good testimony'),
('6b06b02e-f46f-464b-4a44-d4f5a2cd4326', 'de', 'Weil er hofft, ihn bald zu sehen und von Mund zu Mund zu reden'),
('6b06b02e-f46f-464b-4a44-d4f5a2cd4326', 'en', 'Because he hopes to see him soon and speak face to face'),
